English summary
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
CalorieTracker — a local-first Chinese calorie logging app.

Licensed under CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 (see LICENSE): attribution required, **commercial
use prohibited**, derivatives must be shared under the same license. Because the
NC clause restricts fields of use, this is source-available software rather than
